BT 1 0 0 1 0 52.3 Tm /F3 7.2 Tf 8.5 TL 1.296 Tw (Maintaining a structured fitness routine requires more than choosing exercises. Gym) Tj T* 0 Tw .0312 Tw (members need to organize training days, record the work completed during each session,) Tj T* 0 Tw .33768 Tw (and review activity to understand consistency and performance. GymTrack brings these) Tj T* 0 Tw .4134 Tw (tasks into one Android application. Its central workflow connects a saved workout plan) Tj T* 0 Tw .2808 Tw (with an active training session and a history-based progress screen. The supplied source) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.612246 Tw (is local-first: it uses Room for structured persistence and does not define a remote) Tj T* 0 Tw (backend, cloud synchronization, or an account service.) Tj T* ET
